{"sha":"ef8f97992241338cb88335b9d74295e33321b780","node_id":"C_kwDOJPSD-9oAKGVmOGY5Nzk5MjI0MTMzOGNiODgzMzViOWQ3NDI5NWUzMzMyMWI3ODA","commit":{"author":{"name":"Nadir Akhtar","email":"nadir-akhtar@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-06-24T16:43:41Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-24T16:43:41Z"},"message":"docs: add audit report for slash delay & blacklist fix and update readme (#1753) (#1755)\n\n**Motivation:**\n\nThe Certora security assessment for the Redistribution Slash Delay\nUpgrade (PR #1753, v1.13.0) was completed but is not yet published in\nthe `/audits` directory alongside the other EigenLayer audit reports.\n\n**Modifications:**\n\n- Added the final Certora report for the slash resolution delay and\nduration-vault blacklist fix.\n\n**Result:**\n\nUp to date `/audits` dir; the slash-delay upgrade's audit is now\npublicly available.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Nadir Akhtar <9601075+nadir-akhtar@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: ELHAJ <124453227+elhajin@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"489a7728eb22156b86e36a5a9876ae953b021935","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Layr-Labs/eigenlayer-contracts/git/trees/489a7728eb22156b86e36a5a9876ae953b021935"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Layr-Labs/eigenlayer-contracts/git/commits/ef8f97992241338cb88335b9d74295e33321b780","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPAk9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMwQQAC312NunH15GTFTLiRGe6xLj\nSX4c1Hz8GsHL4rANbyifLQLdaT775wsNefMYrcBmgo0n38wM2dfDZvghLDbeynaw\nZZxNNiyYKHQWW/Gfj2f1DQj1y3hZ3GMksG9vLBwTWu3+hxfv90dRBttrECbCrCmh\n8kEs1PF8OfsXXxj165tMrVWoluzcUmF0R5Qx/Bo8TLDguOWFGOIBQldVp0/kte2A\n6Cyz4/h+3e6JVVtcatvISU8IoGV+d4QL5gKJ7gjSpn3c8rS3fEn2072hb+2jV2tD\ne0Cen+vceDTFZDoRDBGFcmAoSDDHFWhbYvM8n8sOYra7zVG/26CAywobuDf2Imnk\n2En2jkVqx7r65IBc1p73tZS9RNjiPYkmM8OGaGobyIhdRJwmTgsK42O/CYQEHmga\nFbBknR0mlScgX189yFb5rpKATp/KpfuojKmgqgG+h3gdTVzMkDw3796P3XQGtKKf